    Ext.create('Ext.data.Store', {
        model: 'Foo',
        proxy: {
            type: 'amf',
            url: 'some/url'
        }
    });

For a detailed tutorial on using AMF data see the
[AMF Guide](../guides/backend_connectors/amf.html).

