+ [W3 Pointer Events](http://www.w3.org/TR/pointerevents/)
+ [W3 Touch Events](http://www.w3.org/TR/touch-events/)
+ [W3 DOM 2 Events](http://www.w3.org/TR/DOM-Level-2-Events/)
